# Backup
# website: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Backup
# docs: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bak_file
# description: Generic backup files, Norton Ghost disk images, original pre-modification copies, and temporary files

# Generic backup files
*.bak
*.back
*.backup

# Norton Ghost backup files
*.gho

# Generic original files
*.ori
*.orig
*.original

# Generic temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.temporary